{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "NOVEMS",
    "steam_appid": 3549210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/3922434c24ed8c205eff934fc8709e0b.poster.avif?t=1750723134\" width=500 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/3922434c24ed8c205eff934fc8709e0b.webm?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/3922434c24ed8c205eff934fc8709e0b.mp4?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange your ideal 9 cards on a page of the magic book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOVEMS is an auto-battler deckbuilder where you collect 9 cards to create your own unique build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose, arrange, and entrust\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the cards do the fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are their master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/cf7d6d047a8c10476e8b5ee7fe4bdf8a.avif?t=1750723134\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where mighty sorcerers clash, forge your ultimate deck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to victory lies in the 3x3 grid of 9 cards you arrange before the battle begins.<br>Out of countless possibilities, what will you discard, and what will you keep?<br>Your choices will decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/8fca61445ad0925a747bb3b6f638321f.poster.avif?t=1750723134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/8fca61445ad0925a747bb3b6f638321f.webm?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/8fca61445ad0925a747bb3b6f638321f.mp4?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/e4836e97fb44787e7759aaa5ba3778d3.avif?t=1750723134\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning is everything\u2014it holds the key to victory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze each card\u2019s traits and uncover the most effective arrangement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where you place your cards determines their effects, action order, and synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically position your forces\u2014and crush even the mightiest foes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/880c083a6726e570b4ed3cb64e56c8aa.poster.avif?t=1750723134\" width=324 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/880c083a6726e570b4ed3cb64e56c8aa.webm?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/880c083a6726e570b4ed3cb64e56c8aa.mp4?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/be945c7a89a53a92103b31f6bf6ee3c6.avif?t=1750723134\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card is strong on its own\u2014but even stronger when linked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By linking with others, a card can unleash its true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place cards of the same type side by side, or meet special conditions to trigger transformations and effects that are impossible on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden synergies and discover the ultimate combos to overwhelm your enemies!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/3b04b61658b34ca96ff832386054dab2.poster.avif?t=1750723134\" width=324 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/3b04b61658b34ca96ff832386054dab2.webm?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/3b04b61658b34ca96ff832386054dab2.mp4?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/f92204ba8eed59e6187b66543c6ce74a.avif?t=1750723134\" data-has-big width=800 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield three distinct magic tomes, each with its own set of cards, and forge your unique strategy.</strong><br>With over 120 cards and 100+ link cards, every decision shapes your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standing in your way are enemies randomly generated for each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange your cards, fight your battles, and push forward toward 10 wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cards you choose, the ones you leave behind, and even those you discard\u2014<br><strong>they all become part of your strategy.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/9a3c0cd771a5897abb94630a48983d15.poster.avif?t=1750723134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/9a3c0cd771a5897abb94630a48983d15.webm?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/9a3c0cd771a5897abb94630a48983d15.mp4?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------<br>Feel free to share and stream your NOVEMS gameplay \u2014 everyone\u2019s welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
