e behind, and even those you discard\u2014<br><strong>they all become part of your strategy.</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/9a3c0cd771a5897abb94630a48983d15.poster.avif?t=1750723134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/9a3c0cd771a5897abb94630a48983d15.webm?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549210/extras/9a3c0cd771a5897abb94630a48983d15.mp4?t=1750723134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------<br>Feel free to share and stream your NOVEMS gameplay \u2014 everyone\u2019s welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
